<section class="section alt"><div class="container"><div class="timeline"><article class="process-card"><p class="eyebrow">01</p><h3>Observe</h3><p>We start by mapping how work actually moves, where it stalls, and where risk accumulates.</p></article>
<article class="process-card"><p class="eyebrow">02</p><h3>Design</h3><p>We create a practical operating model that your team can maintain without specialist support.</p></article>
<article class="process-card"><p class="eyebrow">03</p><h3>Install</h3><p>We turn the plan into playbooks, checklists, dashboards, and decision rules.</p></article>
<article class="process-card"><p class="eyebrow">04</p><h3>Train</h3><p>Leaders and team owners learn the routines, review cadence, and escalation points.</p></article>
<article class="process-card"><p class="eyebrow">05</p><h3>Harden</h3><p>We adjust after real use so the system survives busy seasons, audits, and growth surges.</p></article></div></div></section>
